{"id":"b74c79bf773960d3","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-winning-strategy.md","title":"Winning Strategy","display":"df-winning-strategy — Winning Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-winning-strategy","aliases":["58-df-winning-strategy"],"display":"df-winning-strategy — Winning Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-winning-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-winning-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-winning-strategy — Winning Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,T,A,\\sigma,\\tau,p,i\\in\\mathbf V\">\\(M,T,A,\\sigma,\\tau,p,i\\in\\mathbf V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Outcome}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Outcome}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,T,M)\\leftrightarrow i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land T\\subseteq M^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall k\\leq|s|\\;(s\\upharpoonright k\\in T)\\land\\sigma:\\{s\\in T:|s|\\bmod2=i\\land\\exists m\\in M\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\\}\\to M\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\left(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,T,M)\\leftrightarrow i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land T\\subseteq M^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall k\\leq|s|\\;(s\\upharpoonright k\\in T)\\land\\sigma:\\{s\\in T:|s|\\bmod2=i\\land\\exists m\\in M\\;(s^\\frown\\langle m\\rangle\\in T)\\}\\to M\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\left(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land p\\in M^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left((n\\bmod2=0\\to p(n)=\\sigma(p\\upharpoonright n))\\land(n\\bmod2=1\\to p(n)=\\tau(p\\upharpoonright n))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\land p\\in M^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left((n\\bmod2=0\\to p(n)=\\sigma(p\\upharpoonright n))\\land(n\\bmod2=1\\to p(n)=\\tau(p\\upharpoonright n))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}(\\sigma,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}(\\sigma,T,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\{p\\in M^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,0,T,M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\tau,1,T,M)\\to\\exists p\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Outcome}_S(p,\\sigma,\\tau,T,M)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A winning strategy guarantees victory regardless of opponent's moves.</li>\n<li>Determinacy of a specified payoff class is a theorem asserting that one of the two players has a winning strategy; it is not part of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,T,A,\\sigma,\\tau,p,i\\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Strategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Outcome}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{WinningStrategy}_{I,S}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}winning\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\\mathrm{Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,T,M)\\leftrightarrow i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land T\\subseteq M^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall k\\le